  "project_description": "The Inactive Autologout module allows site administrators to log out users automatically after a specified period of inactivity. It features a user-friendly interface where administrators can configure the inactivity timeout and enable settings based on user roles.\n\n Key features:\n\n \n Customizable Timeout: Easily set inactivity durations to suit your site's requirements. \n Role-Based Settings: Apply inactivity rules to specific roles for greater flexibility and control. \n Lightweight and Efficient: Designed to minimize performance overhead, ensuring seamless integration with your site. \n \n This module is an excellent solution for improving site security and user management while maintaining optimal performance.",
